    "The typical Birgunj street food is similar to that of India’s. There are many street offerings in Birgunj such as Pani Puri, Pav bhaji, variety of chaats,etc. sold by local hawkers or vendors from a movable stall known as Thella. Local people enjoy eating these foods and streets are crowded mostly during the evening. Most of the thellas are also available during evening times only and so the food can be enjoyed as evening snacks but can equally fulfill for dinner time.",
    "Types of Street Food Available in Birgunj"
